  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien klezmer freylekhs, fast Eastern European wedding-dance style. A wailing, bending clarinet leading the melody; a violin doubling with sliding ornaments; accordion playing offbeat chords; slapped upright bass on the downbeat; tight snare and cymbal driving the dance. Lively acoustic band sound, clarinet in front. A bright female mezzo with fast patter and comic sighs, a young male voice answering in the chorus. 140 BPM, D Phrygian dominant. Frantic, wry and dancing. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drop, no gypsy-jazz guitar swing, no Balkan brass band, no electronic drums.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n電風 轉兩工就停\n我抱伊 去店頭欲換\n發票 對皮包提出來\n啊 規張攏白去矣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n少年家 頭殼抓抓\n講阿姨 這是白紙\n\n[Chorus]\n發票白去矣 字走去矣\n日子號碼 攏看無\n你提燈 我提目鏡\n咱兩个 認真來看\n\n[Verse]\n囥佇車頂 曝一禮拜\n熱甲字 攏融去\n伊將發票 斜斜仔看\n我共燈 徙較倚\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n後壁排隊 規陣人\n逐家 煞嘛倚過來\n\n[Chorus]\n發票白去矣 字走去矣\n金額 嘛看無\n你提燈 我提目鏡\n規店的人 鬥陣看\n\n[Verse]\n有一个 阿伯出聲\n講翻過來 揤一下\n淡淡 浮出一个七\n少年家 喝一聲好\n\n[Bridge]\n七月七號 對矣對矣\n電腦內底 有我的名\n規店的人 攏咧拍噗仔\n\n[Chorus]\n發票白去矣 免煩惱\n新的電風 抱轉去\n你提燈 我提目鏡\n後擺發票 囥冰箱\n\n[Outro]\n發票 我會顧予好",
